                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwir dwi Abib, man itim kadhukuwijo ni Yehova Mungu peri; kum i dwi Abib Yehova Mungu peri wodhi woko kud i Misiri ku diewor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ilam kadhukuwijo ni Yehova Mungu peri, kind udul rombe man kind dhok, i ka ma Yehova bigoyo wie, kara eketh nyinge bed keca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kud icam kwen moko ma ie ju thobi kude; cam kwen ma thobi mbe i ie ceng’ abiro kude, en e kwen mi can; kum iai kud i ng’om Misiri ku ng’wec: kara ipoi kum ceng’ m’iai ie woko kud i ng’om Misiri nindo ceke mi kwo peri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ku junen thobi i beng’i i kieu peri ceke ceng’ abiro; kadok ring’o moko, m’ilamu ceng’ ma kwong’ane uthieno, udong’ diewor soro cil kugweno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kud ilam kadhukuwijo yo i dhugang’ peri moko, ma Yehova Mungu peri mio iri: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento i ka ma Yehova Mungu peri bigoyo wie, kara eketh nyinge bed i ie, lam kadhukuwijo uthieno keca, kinde ma ceng’ upodho, i nindo m’iwok ie woko kud i Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ivul icame de i ka ma Mungu peri goyo wie: e ilokri kugweno, man icidh ba hema peri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cam kwen ma thobi mbe i ie ceng’ abusiel; man cokri ma leng’ bibedo i ceng’ mir abirone ni Yehova Mungu peri; kud itim tic moko i ie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
