            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.26+NUM.28.27+NUM.28.28+NUM.28.29+NUM.28.30+NUM.28.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wel 28:26-31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwan iri yenga abiro: mak kwanu yenga abiro ugambre i nindo m’ikwong’o ketho ie pala kum cam ma wi tiende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man itim agba mi yenga ni Yehova Mungu peri kud ajok mi girathiera ma ku berocwiny mi cingi, m’ibimio, calu Yehova Mungu peri mio iri mugisa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man anyong’a negi i wang’ Yehova Mungu peri, in, ku wodi, ku nyeri, ku jamiru peri, man bong’ peri, ku Jalawi ma ni yo i dhugang’ peri, kud umondo, ku kic, man dhaku ma cware tho, ma gini i kindi, i ka ma Yehova Mungu peri bigoyo wie, kara eketh nyinge bed keca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ipoi nia naka in i ng’eca i Misiri: man keth cwinyi kum cik maeni itimgi de.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
