                  "text": "Wel 29:12-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwir agba mi otbak ceng’ abiro, yo ng’ei m’icoko kud i lelacam peri man kud i pany mi pigulok peri: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man anyong’a negi kum agba peri, in, ku wodi, man nyeri, ku jamiru peri, man bong’ peri, ku Jalawi, man umondo, ku kic, man dhaku ma cware tho, ma gini i dhugang’ peri ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwir agba ceng’ abiro ni Yehova Mungu peri i ka ma Yehova bigoyo wie; kum. Yehova Mungu peri bimio mugisa iri i nyai peri ceke, man i tic mi cingi ceke, man anyong’a negi dwanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wang’ adek i rundi acel dhanu peri ma co ceke biwok i wang’ Yehova Mungu peri i ka m’ebigoyo wie: i agba mi kwen ma thobi mbe i ie, man i agba mi yenga, man i agba mi otbak; man ku giwok i wang’ Yehova ma cing’gi nanu: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku ba dhanu ku ba dhanu ng’atuman bimio calu ecopo, calku mugisa pa Yehova Mungu peri m’emio iri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
