          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keth jupoklembe ku jego iri i dhugang’ peri ceke, ma Yehova Mungu peri mio iri, calku suru peri; man gibipoko lembe mi dhanu ku pokolembe ma pwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.23.6+EXO.23.7+EXO.23.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 23:6-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 19:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kud inyoth pokolembe: dhanu kud ubed tung’ tung’ i weng’i; kadi jambng’om de kud igam; kum jambng’om umo wang’ jurieko, man eloko lembe mi weg bedopwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lub tok gin ma ndhu pwe, kara ibed kwo, man imak ng’om ni aba ma Yehova Mungu peri mio iri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
